{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An infestation is spreading in the city of Santa Dant\u00e8s.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viva La Grind is a rollerblading action-adventure game with colossal combat encounters and fluid movement. You play as Gigi, an acrobatic hero equipped with roller blades powered by wind and style!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOVEMENT IS COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind on rails, ride along billboards and boost through the air using a pair of high-tech roller blades. Use the environment and your movement skills to reach your enemy\u2019s weak spots and bring them down!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIBERATE THE CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vibrant metropolis of Santa Dant\u00e8s; a cultural capital now under threat. STEEL Corp has taken over, vowing to replace the natural world with their machines. It's your job to fight back and inspire the citizens to\u00a0protect their city from losing its soul.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879450?t=1770702573","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879450?t=1770702573","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879450/1ea758165d9675090e847f657329895c2fb78392/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770702573","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879450/1ea758165d9675090e847f657329895c2fb78392/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770702573","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An infestation is spreading in the city of Santa Dant\u00e8s.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viva La Grind is a rollerblading action-adventure game with colossal combat encounters and fluid movement. You play as Gigi, an acrobatic hero equipped with roller blades powered by wind and style!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOVEMENT IS COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind on rails, ride along billboards and boost through the air using a pair of high-tech roller blades. Use the environment and your movement skills to reach your enemy\u2019s weak spots and bring them down!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIBERATE THE CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vibrant metropolis of Santa Dant\u00e8s; a cultural capital now under threat. STEEL Corp has taken over, vowing to replace the natural world with their machines. It's your job to fight back and inspire the citizens to\u00a0protect their city from losing its soul.</p>","developers":["Masked Moonlight"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879450/6059286da15470a3a9c087535894da34d2909851/header.jpg?t=1770702573","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Viva La Grind","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Masked Moonlight"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Verbrechen","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared